9), and a translation into Russian of already published fragments: «In epistolas B. Pauli commentarii» (Eph. 1, 22–23) and a fragment of «Contra magos», previously discovered by J. G. Reinink.</note></biblStruct><bibl type="formatted" subtype="bibliography" resp="https://www.zotero.org/styles/chicago-note-bibliography-17th-edition">
